<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<title>Код подтверждения</title>
	<style>
		body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f6f8; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #1f2937; }
		.email-background { background-color: #f4f6f8; }
		.email-container { max-width: 560px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; }
		.email-content { padding: 40px; }
		.email-spacing { padding: 40px 16px; }
		h1 { margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 24px; line-height: 32px; }
		.intro { margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; }
		.code { margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 40px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 8px; text-align: center; color: #2563eb; }
		.expiration { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #6b7280; }
	</style>
</head>
<body>
	<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" class="email-background">
		<tr>
			<td align="center" class="email-spacing">
				<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" class="email-container">
					<tr>
						<td class="email-content">
							<h1>Здравствуйте, {{name}}!</h1>
							<p class="intro">Используйте этот код для подтверждения:</p>
							<p class="code">{{code}}</p>
							<p class="expiration">Код действителен до {{expires}}.</p>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td>
		</tr>
	</table>
</body>
</html>
